Coordinator, merge note for head 2726446c4c7954179724877203d1be0f8f5c117c. Class: no refresh (the head is the reviewed head).

This merge relies on:
- the review marker on this head (21:56Z, "Ready for the maintainer to merge");
- my read of the diff: `list_operation_types` lists the Wire Contour fields that the DTO does not write when they are empty; one test pins the listed fields against `WireContourDto` and the skill text against the live fields, machines and posts; the skill row is corrected;
- a trial merge here, on `main` 6cfc0a6d4 (the merge is clean and changes only the three files): the whole quick plan, 25 steps, 0 failed (the app lib 298 passed, the twelve `mcp_*` binaries, `mcp_wire_contour` 8 passed with the new test); `mcp_doc_drift` 6 passed (the second test that reads the skill file); clippy on the `camcraft-app` lib and on the test target is clean.

The PR has `Process change: yes` (it changes a skill file). The `PROCESS_VERSION` bump follows.

A note for #3537: the new test pins the present post name "Agie native wire EDM" in the skill text. The rename of #3537 ("Native wire EDM job files") must change this row and the test with it.

@paulsvc thank you for this fix.
